#N canvas 20 20 1500 1500 12;
#X text 20 20 e_drive -- one drum track's distortion \, inside its c_voice: the sound scaled to its sample's peak and driven into one of four characters \, soft \, hard \, fold or crush \, a one-pole low-pass for its tone \, and mixed with the dry sound (Brendan \, 2026-11-05). ref/module/sequencer.md, f 70;
#X text 20 130 creation args: none. inlet~: the voice's sound \, at its velocity and volume. inlet: drive <0-100> \, tone <0-100> \, dist <0-100> \, the mix \, and char <1-4> \, soft \, hard \, fold or crush \, from c_steps through c_kit and c_voice \, and peak <x> \, its sample's peak \, from c_voice once the sample is read. outlet~: what the distortion adds to the dry sound \, mix x (driven - dry) \, which c_voice sums with the dry: at mix 100 only the driven sound is heard \, and at 0 this is off and the dry passes untouched., f 70;
